<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<jmeterTestPlan version="1.2" properties="5.0" jmeter="5.6.3">
  <hashTree>
    <TestPlan guiclass="TestPlanGui" testclass="TestPlan" testname="AI Service - Rate Limiting Comparison" enabled="true">
      <stringProp name="TestPlan.comments">Lab 5 - Security Patterns - Rate Limiting Comparison
      
WITH Rate Limiting:
  1. Normal Traffic     - 2 users, 2s timer (should pass)
  2. Baseline           - 5 users, burst (triggers 429)
  3. Burst              - 20 users simultaneous (triggers 429)
  4. Sustained          - 15 users ramp-up 60s (triggers 429)

WITHOUT Rate Limiting (disable RL before running):
  5. Normal Traffic     - same as 1
  6. Baseline           - same as 2
  7. Burst              - same as 3
  8. Sustained          - same as 4
      </stringProp>
      <boolProp name="TestPlan.functional_mode">false</boolProp>
      <boolProp name="TestPlan.serialize_threadgroups">false</boolProp>
      <elementProp name="TestPlan.arguments" elementType="Arguments" guiclass="ArgumentsPanel" testclass="Arguments" testname="User Defined Variables">
        <collectionProp name="Arguments.arguments">
          <elementProp name="HOST" elementType="Argument">
            <stringProp name="Argument.name">HOST</stringProp>
            <stringProp name="Argument.value">localhost</stringProp>
          </elementProp>
          <elementProp name="PORT" elementType="Argument">
            <stringProp name="Argument.name">PORT</stringProp>
            <stringProp name="Argument.value">8443</stringProp>
          </elementProp>
          <elementProp name="AI_PATH" elementType="Argument">
            <stringProp name="Argument.name">AI_PATH</stringProp>
            <stringProp name="Argument.value">/ai/chat/</stringProp>
          </elementProp>
        </collectionProp>
      </elementProp>
    </TestPlan>
    <hashTree>
      <ThreadGroup guiclass="ThreadGroupGui" testclass="ThreadGroup" testname="1 - [CON RL] Normal Traffic">
        <intProp name="ThreadGroup.num_threads">2</intProp>
        <intProp name="ThreadGroup.ramp_time">5</intProp>
        <boolProp name="ThreadGroup.same_user_on_next_iteration">true</boolProp>
        <stringProp name="ThreadGroup.on_sample_error">continue</stringProp>
        <elementProp name="ThreadGroup.main_controller" elementType="LoopController" guiclass="LoopControlPanel" testclass="LoopController">
          <stringProp name="LoopController.loops">5</stringProp>
          <boolProp name="LoopController.continue_forever">false</boolProp>
        </elementProp>
      </ThreadGroup>
